// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Glow Waves.
//
// EXCLUSIVE WITH SEAMLESS CORNERS, and the menu says so rather than quietly
// picking a winner. The corner works by matching reach across the junction so
// both sides arrive at the shared line agreeing; undulate one side and they
// stop meeting, and every corner in the game grows a seam that moves. Either
// the room is bounded by continuous colour with no edge anywhere, or it is
// bounded by an edge that moves. Two different rooms, one choice.
